                            <comment id="14733440" author="khalidhuseynov" created="Mon, 7 Sep 2015 09:09:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is an example screenshot when we restarted %spark interpreter when second paragraph (taking one minute to execute) was &quot;running&quot;. After refreshing the page we can see that 3rd and 4th paragraphs keep pending forever. Currently, the only way to resolve it is to create new paragraph, copy content there, and delete existing one.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14743186" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 14 Sep 2015 08:58:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user khalidhuseynov opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/306&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/306&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Abort &quot;Pending&quot; or &quot;Running&quot; issues on Interpreter restart&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This PR address the following issue &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-285&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-285&lt;/a&gt; . The idea is to abort all the jobs which are either running or waiting to run on the interpreter that is going to be restarted.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

